osmatrix patch for nektos/act v0.2.89 (MIT, https://github.com/nektos/act)

osmatrix builds act from the v0.2.89 source archive with this patch applied (src/core/act.ts), because
stock act differs from GitHub's runners in ways that break real workflows:

- pkg/runner/step.go, pkg/runner/run_context.go: file commands (GITHUB_OUTPUT, GITHUB_ENV, GITHUB_PATH,
  GITHUB_STATE, GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY) live under $RUNNER_TEMP/_runner_file_commands/ as on GitHub, not
  under act's own workflow/ directory, so path-containment checks pass. A per-job volume
  (<job container>-filecmds, removed with the job) shares the directory with docker container actions.
  Source: https://github.com/fritz-fritz/osmatrix/issues/23 (v2 of the patch in the issue). Not
  upstream; nektos/act#6154 reworks the same code.
- pkg/artifacts/artifacts_v4.go: the v4 artifact server works with actions/upload-artifact v7 and
  download-artifact v7/v8. It accepts request fields it doesn't know, accepts signed URLs whose base64
  padding the client dropped, and keeps the uploaded mime_type, returning it with a Content-Disposition
  filename so `archive: false` uploads download under their own name.
  Source: nektos/act#6174 (open, unmerged), head commit 8e8385ed6b45b72ad119c206daf4cd034596ff3a,
  artifacts_v4.go only (its tests and testdata are left out). Upstream issues: nektos/act#6022, #6114,
  #6173; https://github.com/fritz-fritz/osmatrix/issues/24.
  osmatrix additions on top of #6174 (suggested in our review of it, not in the PR):
  - buildArtifactURL signs with base64.RawURLEncoding, so no "=" appears in the query; verifySignature
    still accepts padded signatures, so URLs issued earlier keep working.
  - artifactV4ContentType reads the proto3 JSON lowerCamelCase key mimeType as well as mime_type
    (mime_type wins when both are set).

Drop a part once an act release osmatrix moves to includes it. Changing this file changes the build's
cache key, so osmatrix rebuilds act on its next run. Apply it with `git apply` or `patch -p1` in the
root of the v0.2.89 source tree.

